      "sections": [
        {
          "section_type": "example_question",
          "normalized_html": "<p>Find <span class=\"math\">[MATH: \\mathbf{a}-2\\mathbf{b}]</span> if <span class=\"math\">[MATH: \\mathbf{a}=-4\\mathbf{i}+6\\mathbf{j}]</span> and <span class=\"math\">[MATH: \\mathbf{b}=12\\mathbf{i}.]</span></p>",
          "readable_text": "Find [MATH: \\mathbf{a}-2\\mathbf{b}] if [MATH: \\mathbf{a}=-4\\mathbf{i}+6\\mathbf{j}] and [MATH: \\mathbf{b}=12\\mathbf{i}.]",
          "images": [],
          "free_entry_blanks": [],
          "select_lists": []
        },
        {
          "section_type": "content",
          "normalized_html": "<p>EXPLANATION</p>",
          "readable_text": "EXPLANATION",
          "images": [],
          "free_entry_blanks": [],
          "select_lists": []
        },
        {
          "section_type": "example_explanation",
          "normalized_html": "<p>To compute <span class=\"math\">[MATH: \\mathbf{a}-2\\mathbf{b},]</span> we just need to compute all of the <span class=\"math\">[MATH: \\mathbf{i}]</span>&#x27;s and <span class=\"math\">[MATH: \\mathbf{j}]</span>&#x27;s, as follows:\n<span class=\"math\">[MATH: a \u2212 2b|= (\u2212 4i + 6j) \u2212 2(12i); = \u2212 4i + 6j \u2212 24i; = (\u2212 4i \u2212 24i) + 6j; = \u2212 28i + 6j]</span></p>",
          "readable_text": "To compute [MATH: \\mathbf{a}-2\\mathbf{b},] we just need to compute all of the [MATH: \\mathbf{i}]'s and [MATH: \\mathbf{j}]'s, as follows:\n[MATH: a \u2212 2b|= (\u2212 4i + 6j) \u2212 2(12i); = \u2212 4i + 6j \u2212 24i; = (\u2212 4i \u2212 24i) + 6j; = \u2212 28i + 6j]",
          "images": [],
          "free_entry_blanks": [],
          "select_lists": []
        }
      ],
      "images": [],
      "free_entry_blanks": [],
      "select_lists": [],
      "readable_text": "Example Prompt:\nFind [MATH: \\mathbf{a}-2\\mathbf{b}] if [MATH: \\mathbf{a}=-4\\mathbf{i}+6\\mathbf{j}] and [MATH: \\mathbf{b}=12\\mathbf{i}.]\n\nContent:\nEXPLANATION\n\nExplanation:\nTo compute [MATH: \\mathbf{a}-2\\mathbf{b},] we just need to compute all of the [MATH: \\mathbf{i}]'s and [MATH: \\mathbf{j}]'s, as follows:\n[MATH: a \u2212 2b|= (\u2212 4i + 6j) \u2212 2(12i); = \u2212 4i + 6j \u2212 24i; = (\u2212 4i \u2212 24i) + 6j; = \u2212 28i + 6j]"
